model g7_flows_touched
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.6 (P40), G7: reads (L §5.14, §5.14.3, §8.2) where 2.1.5 and 2.1.6 agree. A movement refused by its when, from world into konto2 on 2026-03-10: flows of konto2 over spans before it, across it, after it and from before the run's start, bal before, on and after its day, and flows of the move by leg and by key. A hole day into box_h, read before the refused day. bal(fresh, d) with uncertain on a place with no reading, before, between and after its two uncertain movements. Flows of a move over a span with no movement: of a kind whose one leg has a unit, between outside places, and of one leg of a kind whose two legs are in two units."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

unit EUR: currency minor 0.01

kind maybe: transfers uncertain

kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

kind swaps: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
  leg fee: EUR

index month = month 2026-01..2026-03

place konto2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place box_h: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place fresh: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place shop: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input amt: money PLN

input fee_amt: money EUR

input gate_dom: int

input div_when[m in month]: num

input hole_day: date question "When does the parcel come?"

input u_in: date

input u_late: date

input ext_day: date

move gate[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, gate_dom)
  when div_when[m] * div_when[m] / div_when[m] > 0
  leg cash from world to konto2 amount amt

move parcel: transfers
  on hole_day
  leg cash from world to box_h amount amt

move fr_in: maybe
  on u_in
  leg cash from world to fresh amount amt

move fr_late: maybe
  on u_late
  leg cash from world to fresh amount amt

move ext: pays
  on ext_day
  leg cash from world to shop amount amt

move swap: swaps
  on ext_day
  leg cash from world to shop amount amt
  leg fee from world to shop amount fee_amt

ask q_place: flows(konto2, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(konto2, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31), flows(konto2, 2026-03-11 .. 2026-03-31), flows(konto2, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-03-09), flows(konto2, 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31), flows(box_h, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31), flows(box_h, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28) law cut

ask q_bal: bal(konto2, d) for d in [2026-02-28, 2026-03-09, 2026-03-10, 2026-03-31] law cut

ask q_move: flows(gate.cash, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(gate.cash, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-03-31), flows(gate[2026-02].cash, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-03-31), flows(gate[2026-03], 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31), flows(gate, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(ext, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-10), flows(swap.cash, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-10), flows(swap.fee, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-10), flows(ext, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31) law cut

ask q_unc: bal(fresh, d) with uncertain for d in [2026-01-22, 2026-01-24, 2026-01-28] law cut

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  fee_amt = 2.00 EUR
  gate_dom = 10
  div_when[2026-01] = 1
  div_when[2026-02] = 2
  div_when[2026-03] = 0
  u_in = 2026-01-23
  u_late = 2026-01-27
  ext_day = 2026-01-15

version openings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-31
  opening[konto2] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[box_h] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

